- **Location**: skills/design/scripts/render-plan-review-prompt.sh:107-127; skills/design/references/brainstorm.md:60-72; skills/design/references/sketch-launch.md:39-73
- **Concern**: Plan adds a readability token to reference prose but omits the actual render and launch surfaces that must expand it. Scenario: The plan-review renderer still emits its heredoc directly, and brainstorm/sketch launch instructions assemble prompts from placeholder bodies; external agents either receive no preamble or a literal <READABILITY_STYLE> token
