- **Concern**: Plan updates plan-review.md but the actual external plan-review prompt is emitted by render-plan-review-prompt.sh, and the plan does not add that renderer or its harness to the change set. Scenario: Step 3 Cursor/Codex reviewers keep receiving prompts without expanded readability guidance, so reviewer finding text and OOS descriptions miss a stated amendment site despite plan.txt line 106 saying helper-rendered prompts must substitute the token
